=== On Slayer task ===
Each boss counts as an [[ice giant]] or [[fire giant]] task respectively. The [[Slayer helmet (i)|imbued slayer helm]] can boost damage on task.

The only slayer master that assigns both is [[Vannaka]], and you can optimize his blocklist to be Titans specific.

Alternatively if you only need the fire giant task, [[Chaeldar]], [[Nieve]] and [[Duradel]] can assign them, but without the possibility of ice giants.

===Low Level / Sustain===
When fighting the Titans solo or in a duo with low end gear and stats, it may be easier to bring fewer switches and more supplies so you can kill more Titans before you have to bank. With lower damage output, it is recommended to use the [[Standard spellbook|standard spellbook]] to deal with the elementals and barriers, as their damage will add up quickly. 

