Late game=
* A Ranged switch to hit the Titans when out of melee range
* A Noxious halberd to hit the titans for additional damage during the elemental blast attack if the safespot is in the middle
* Runes to destroy ice and fire barriers. Optionally bring a mage switch for 70+ magic accuracy if killing the elementals.
* [[Prayer potion]]s
* A [[divine super combat potion]] and [[divine ranging potion]]
* [[Divine rune pouch]] with runes to cast [[Water Wave]] and [[Fire Wave]] (Fire and Water runes are optional if you have the [[Twinflame Staff]] as the staff provides infinite water and fire runes)
* [[Giantsoul amulet]] to get to the boss quickly
* Emergency and/or bank teleport
